  skos:note "Example Implementations: Kurator/FilteredPush geo_ref_qc Library (Morris & Lowery 2025b)",
    "Example Implementations Source Code: https://github.com/FilteredPush/geo_ref_qc/blob/v2.0.1/src/main/java/org/filteredpush/qc/georeference/DwCGeoRefDQ.java#L1121",
